    - {round: 8, reviewers: "R1,R2", note: "New missing refs: Golchin & Surdeanu, Sainz et al., Yang et al."}
    - {round: 10, reviewers: "R1,R2", note: "58 citations verified, references now comprehensive."}
    - {round: 11, reviewers: "R1,R2", note: "New missing: Rodriguez et al. (2021), Carlini et al. (2023), Gu et al. (2024) OLMES."}
    - {round: 12, reviewers: "R1,R2", note: "R1 suggests Recht et al. (2019), Srivastava et al. (2023 BIG-bench), Ye et al. (2024) Data Contamination Quiz. R2 suggests Jiang et al. (2024). None are must-cite. Related work coverage generally adequate."}
  action_items:
