    - {round: 10, reviewers: "R1,R2", note: "Both suggest explicit positioning statement."}
    - {round: 11, reviewers: "R2", note: "Excitement=2.5, 'different models respond differently' not surprising."}
    - {round: 12, reviewers: "R1,R2", note: "Both agree core novelty is in controlled injection paradigm, not IRT modeling. ContamCal calibration showing no MAE advantage (Table 3) further weakens method contribution. Paper §3.4 adds explicit positioning statement but positioning as method paper still partially present in pipeline naming and narrative."}
  action_items:
