    - {round: 10, reviewers: "R1,R2", note: "DiD rated Acceptable."}
    - {round: 12, reviewers: "", note: "本轮未直接提及（fresh review）。DiD analysis not re-raised; parallel trends addressed in §5.4 pre-treatment balance."}
  resolution: "Contribution 2 includes 'at current power levels'. MDES reported."
  resolution_round: 9

- id: "R8-N3"
  summary: "N=6 model families supporting 4-class taxonomy — generalization evidence insufficient"
  category: experiment
  severity: critical
  status: in_progress
  first_raised_round: 8
  last_seen_round: 12
  mentions:
    - {round: 8, reviewers: "R1,R2", note: "4 patterns on 4 families is post-hoc."}
    - {round: 9, reviewers: "R1,R2", note: "Reposition as 'observed profiles'."}
    - {round: 10, reviewers: "R1,R2", note: "CONSENSUS Must-Fix. Collapse n=1, V-recovery n=1, both Qwen2.5."}
    - {round: 11, reviewers: "R1,R2", note: "CONSENSUS Critical. Qwen-14B Collapse vs Qwen-7B V-recovery contradicts family-level consistency."}
    - {round: 12, reviewers: "R1,R2", note: "CONSENSUS Critical (strongest consensus issue). R2-N1: 6 models → 4 patterns ≈ overfitting. Collapse/V-recovery from same family (Qwen2.5) may reflect family-specific artifacts (position bias amplification, Appendix R). OOS validation covers only Immune (LLaMA-3.1). R1 agrees fully, adds: Appendix Z parametric models classify Gemma-2/OLMo-2 as Constant (indistinguishable from null). Title 'Not All Models Are Inflated' overclaims for 6-model SFT study. Both recommend: (1) Collapse/V-recovery as preliminary Qwen-specific observations; (2) title qualifier; (3) or 2-3 additional independent families."}
  action_items:
    - {round: 9, action: "Fix §5.1 count. Use 'preliminary at N=5'", assigned_to: "paper_agent", status: "done"}
    - {round: 10, action: "Replace 'taxonomy' with 'profiles'; acknowledge Collapse/V-recovery single-family", assigned_to: "paper_agent", status: "open"}
    - {round: 11, action: "Discuss within-family inconsistency (Qwen-14B vs 7B)", assigned_to: "paper_agent", status: "done"}
    - {round: 12, action: "Explicitly label Collapse and V-recovery as 'preliminary observations within Qwen2.5, pending independent-family replication'; consider title qualifier", assigned_to: "paper_agent", status: "open"}

